-- Q7812: Incident Response and Recovery [medium/L3]
-- Issues: #3
UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Per NIST SP 800-34, the BIA establishes the Maximum Tolerable Downtime (MTD)—here, 8 hours—and the RTO must be set below the MTD to ensure recovery completes before irreversible financial harm occurs. The RTO is derived from business impact analysis, not arbitrary standards.
